'''Showoffs''' (大道芸猫, ''Daidōgē Neko'', '''Street Performance Cat''') is a 2-slot [[Cat Combo]]. It is unlocked after completing [[Into the Future]] Chapter 3.

==Effect==
'''Current Version''': Worker Cat Max Up (Sm): Wallet size is increased by 10%.

'''Pre 4.7''': "Weaken" Effect Up (Sm): Weaken duration increases by 10%.

